Original project: opencode-model-router
Original author: Marco Jardim
Upstream repository: https://github.com/marco-jardim/opencode-model-router
Upstream license: GPL-3.0-only

This fork is unofficial. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the
