Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

- Professional capability branches `@animator` (frontend), `@eyes` (vision) and `@ears`
  (audio), implemented in `src/router/branches.ts` and wired into the delegation protocol
  in `src/router/protocol.ts`. The branch catalogue itself is data, in `tiers.json`.
- Declarative `models` alias registry and per-tier `use`, so a model/variant/effort
  bundle is written once and inherited, parsed in `src/router/config.ts`.
- `providers` capability profiles (`family`, `effortKnob`, `maxEffort`) in
  `src/router/agent-options.ts`, replacing provider-family guessing from model id
  strings; the legacy heuristics remain as a warned fallback.
- Clearable `variant: null`.
- `key+` array-append merge semantics for configuration layers.
- Additions: `schema/opencode-model-router.schema.json`, `docs/` (bilingual),
  `examples/`, and `scripts/transcribe.py`.

